  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 604.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 604.01 Purpose. The purposes of this part are to identify those circumstances in which a responsible party or other person is required to notify the department and to set forth the procedures for such notification.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Or 600) #8812, eff 2-1-07; ss by #10831, eff 6-1-15; ss by #14419, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
